This repository contains derivative works adapted from
https://github.com/jamditis/claude-skills-journalism (MIT, Copyright (c) 2025
Joe Amditis). Substantive changes include rewriting the foia-requests skill
to cover Taiwan's Freedom of Government Information Law (政府資訊公開法)
rather than U.S. federal FOIA and state public records laws, and (planned)
adaptation of other skills to Taiwan's media, regulatory, and platform
landscape.

The legal information in foia-requests is informational and does not
constitute legal advice. Consult a licensed attorney for matters involving
administrative appeals or litigation.
